  "sourceTitle": "Homemade Hot Dog Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Homemade Hot Dog Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 5, 2009 - 11:59pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 lbs. hamburger\n2 lg. onions or suit to taste\n2 (4 oz.) bottles of ketchup\n2 teaspoons paprika\n1 teaspoon garlic powder\n1/2 teaspoon garlic salt\nSalt and pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Simmer in crock pot for 2 hours. (Great for Sloppy Joes, too).",
